noPhotos

# higher D** Dst2S -> D* pi pi (ISGW2, PHSP), as the LHCb CocktailHigher
# LHCb-style cocktail component (DecFiles Sim10 11874430/12873450, 11676012/12675402), e/mu 50/50

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0  B0sig  anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay

Decay anti-B0sig
0.5  D*(2S)+  e-  anti-nu_e   ISGW2;
0.5  D*(2S)+  mu-  anti-nu_mu  ISGW2;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig

Decay D*(2S)+
1.0  D*+  pi+  pi-   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay D*(2S)-

End
